/* ===== Wonderland redesign, round 16 (Charlie, 25 November 2026) =====
   1. The water in Home's garden fountain flows. A soft run of light falls down each stream the painting already has: the
      streams were traced from the painting itself (day and night, large and small copies, ../rdart/ftn), and the run of
      light shows only through them, placed wherever the painting is cropped. It stays still (and away) for calm motion.
   2. Side-by-side containers on Home keep their buttons level: where a button sits under its words, the words of the two
      containers side by side take the same height.
   The Spotlight on the Cowork scenarios leaving At a glance, the Cheshire Cat in the Events painting, the level buttons on
   the overviews and the library's dark search box are in rd.js, rd7.js, rd13.js and rd.css (round 16 notes there).
   It runs inside rd.js (joined after rd15.js). */
